          "text": "Hanyuma Yehowasi mwene Yehowahazi agarura ibisagara Beni‐hadadi mwene Hazayeli yari yaranyaze se Yehowahazi mu ntambara. Yehowasi amunesha gatatu, agarura ibisagara vy’i Bgisirayeli.",
